From 57aef9f19f41028f63bb934965a4fd0c2709f3ca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mini <mini@local>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:37:37 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 05/10] Default to local-only Zed Mini instance with lazy
 stores and fast config read

Isolates Zed Mini's single-instance port and data/state/cache/log paths,
defaults to local-only settings (no AI, telemetry, auto-update, collab,
or package-version-server), reads config files before arming FSEvents
watchers, pre-parses default settings, opens PromptStore's LMDB lazily,
and skips reliability hang/memory pollers when telemetry is disabled.
